    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000szdy](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000szdy) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 47.73 depth occurred on May 22 2026 116 km ESE of Bitung, Indonesia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 1.0936 longitude 126.114. It impacted 1836 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
